  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekondering till Open Data/Governance specialist  till V&#xe4;rldsbanken i Tanzania</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sekondment of specialist Open Data/Governance     to World Bank in Tanzania - Sekondment of specialist Open Data/Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The World Bank is intrumental to the tanzanian governemnt&#xb4;s          committment to Open Government Partnership. A small Secretariat is    working on the topics of increased transparance and access to         information. Since the work is now moving into a more active phase    the World Bank has, knowing that Sweden share a keen interestin the   the area,  asked the Embassy for additional personell resources.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xd6;kad transparens och anti-korruption &#xe4;r centrala delar i den svenska resultatstrategin i Tanzania. St&#xf6;det sker i form av en sekondering d&#xe5; det bed&#xf6;ms som ett kostandseffektivt s&#xe4;tt att st&#xe4;rka samordning samt m&#xf6;jligheterna f&#xf6;r V&#xe4;rldsbanken att genomf&#xf6;ra sitt program kring transparens, &#xf6;ppen data och b&#xe4;ttre service f&#xf6;r medborgarna. Vi kan dessutom bidra till st&#xe4;rkt kompetens p&#xe5; V&#xe4;rldsbanken i omr&#xe5;den med h&#xf6;g svensk profil.</narrative>
  </description>
